, if your answer is yes. Also, would like to communicate with Mr. Grigg, thank you for responding....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/7817155191898221250'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/7817155191898221250'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html?showComment=1483983483265#c7817155191898221250' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5549669166178513536' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5549669166178513536' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1594121944"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 9, 2017 at 10:38 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8481019459009964324</id><published>2016-09-07T10:03:09.748-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-07T10:03:09.748-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Just wondered abt the other 2 men that were there ...</title><content type='html'>Just wondered abt the other 2 men that were there that night. No one really talked much to them.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/8481019459009964324'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/8481019459009964324'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html?showComment=1473264189748#c8481019459009964324' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5549669166178513536' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5549669166178513536' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-565383515"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 7, 2016 at 10:03 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6132676832303096320</id><published>2016-09-06T14:10:51.782-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-06T14:10:51.782-06:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>This comment has been removed by the author.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/6132676832303096320'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/6132676832303096320'/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/9012286371101799441'/><author><name>Invested</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/10786925147298016875</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5549669166178513536' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5549669166178513536' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name='blogger.contentRemoved' value='true'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1618165584"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 6, 2016 at 2:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-294746992489257089</id><published>2016-09-04T03:00:07.325-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-04T03:00:07.325-06:00</updated><title type='text'>“In keeping silent about evil, in burying it so de...</title><content type='html'>“In keeping silent about evil, in burying it so deep within us that no sign of it appears on the surface, we are implanting it, and it will rise up a thousand fold in the future. When we neither punish nor reproach evildoers, we are not simply protecting their trivial old age, we are thereby ripping the foundations of justice from beneath new generations.”&lt;br /&gt;― Aleksandr Solzhenitsyn, The Gulag Archipelago 1918-1956 </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/294746992489257089'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/294746992489257089'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html?showComment=1472979607325#c294746992489257089' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5549669166178513536' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5549669166178513536' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-737564002"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 4, 2016 at 3:00 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8467752210161033242</id><published>2016-09-02T22:24:45.893-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-02T22:24:45.893-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The root of the problem lies with those victimized...</title><content type='html'>The root of the problem lies with those victimized by tyranny.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As Jefferson so aptly said, &amp;quot;When governments fear the people, there is liberty. When the people fear the government, there is tyranny.” Or as I summarize it, &amp;quot;Liberty is a demand. Tyranny is submission.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That means that the responsibility and defense of Liberty relies upon those desiring it. Tyranny is not imposed, but permitted. The cause then of the growing malignancy of treason and tyranny within our American country is our acquiescence to it.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Resistance and retribution to tyranny is not just an individual&amp;#39;s choice, but also a responsibility, a duty, to his fellow countrymen--&amp;quot;...it is their duty...&amp;quot; By not resisting or responding with retributions against tyranny&amp;#39;s crimes, one diminishes tyranny&amp;#39;s fear of the rest of the victim&amp;#39;s countrymen. The result is heightened tyrannical behavior by tyranny against one&amp;#39;s neighbors and fellow countrymen.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The victims of tyranny that survive, and their family members and friends, must, for their sake, and the sake of their country, respond with resistance and retribution in a way that leave those that would also commit such crimes shaking in their boots. To not do so is cowardice, and damning to their fellow countrymen as well.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is not about revenge, as revenge is selfish. It is about holding those committing such crimes responsibly for their behavior, and, more importantly, deterring the others of tyranny from same. This is also part of the lesson of the Stanford Prison, and Milgram, experiments--lack of accountability breeds tyranny.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As for myself, I have taken a personal oath to rain hell fire down upon those, and their associates, that would have harmed those of my family. Beat or kill a child of mine? Beat or kill my father or grandfather? Taze my grandmother to death? Be prepared to experience violence of a level unimaginable. A level calculated to give even tyranny&amp;#39;s most recalcitrant thugs pause the next time they ponder waging tyranny upon another American. A pause then that can be multiplied as others take actions against those that have harmed their loved ones,friends, and ultimately, fellow countrymen.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;An American citizen, not US subject.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/8467752210161033242'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/8467752210161033242'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html?showComment=1472876685893#c8467752210161033242' title=''/><author><name>K. Chris</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03023274775918870871</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5549669166178513536' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5549669166178513536' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-82698132"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2016 at 10:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3965253333392351844</id><published>2016-09-02T09:50:16.501-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-02T09:50:16.501-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thank you!</title><content type='html'>Thank you!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/3965253333392351844'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/3965253333392351844'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html?showComment=1472831416501#c3965253333392351844' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='//3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5549669166178513536' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5549669166178513536' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2016 at 9:50 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4396750656443181104</id><published>2016-09-02T09:40:22.084-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-02T09:40:22.084-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Could I speak with you sometime? WNGrigg[at]msn[do...</title><content type='html'>Could I speak with you sometime? WNGrigg[at]msn[dot]com. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/4396750656443181104'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/4396750656443181104'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html?showComment=1472830822084#c4396750656443181104' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='//3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5549669166178513536' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5549669166178513536' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2016 at 9:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9012286371101799441</id><published>2016-09-02T09:38:36.509-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-02T09:38:36.509-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Angie lived 2 blocks down from where I was renting...</title><content type='html'>Angie lived 2 blocks down from where I was renting in 1996.  I attempted to give evidence to the police on 2 different occasions,  but was never taken seriously.  I contacted police again in 2009 and was not taken seriously. My memory has faded, so it is hard to recall the events of that night.  I don&amp;#39;t know that my tips are worth anything, but I was bothered by the fact that I was quickly dismissed by the authorities in Idaho Falls. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I was working in the media over 20 years ago so I had an opportunity to view the post-mortem pictures of Ms. Dodge.  They will forever haunt me.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/9012286371101799441'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5549669166178513536/comments/default/9012286371101799441'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html?showComment=1472830716509#c9012286371101799441' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/08/the-state-as-accomplice-did-idahos.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5549669166178513536' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5549669166178513536' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-144036687"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 2, 2016 at 9:38 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2950934843654429227</id><published>2016-08-31T17:41:56.998-06:00</published><updated>2016-08-31T17:41:56.998-06:00</updated><title type='text'>WILLIAM, I sure do appreciate these articles you w...</title><content type='html'>WILLIAM, I sure do appreciate these articles you write about corrupt law enforcement personnel, judges and lawyers. There are too few websites like